SWEET_DREAM_COUNTDOWN_POWER.description:
Sweet Dream's count drops by 1 each time it takes damage; additionally, each turn it steals [gold]{StealCount}[/gold] random card(s) from its target's hand ([gold]{StolenCount}[/gold] currently held). When the count reaches 0, every stolen card returns to your hand, and Sweet Dream then resets the count and gains Strength.
